{2}\\to {R}^{2}$ be a linear transformation. Find $[\\,T\\,]_{B}\\,$ if $\\,T({b}_{1})={b}_{2}-2{b}_{2}+{b}_{1}\\,$ and $\\,T({b}_{2})=3{b}_{2}+2{b}_{1}-5{b}_{2}.$" :question/worked-solution "Since we have $\\,T({b}_{1})={b}_{1}-{b}_{2}\\,$ and $\\,T({b}_{2})=2{b}_{1}-2{b}_{2}\\,$, we have\n\n$$\n[T({b}_{1})]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,[T({b}_{2})]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, the $B$-matrix for $T$ is a matrix  whose columns are the coordinates of the vectors $T({b}_{1})$ and $T({b}_{2})$ relative to the basis $B.$ Therefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n[\\,T\\,]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-38913/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6641b2cf-00bc-5542-a566-5b8689f2f2a4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-38913"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-82458/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "ab4d1dc7-4062-5af2-b0e3-5075b61c677a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-82458/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "c7129cc8-20d1-50af-860e-db016a5f3fed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-82458/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "40fd7a34-3bbd-560d-8623-84ad5d67430f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-82458/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "fce619c5-9d76-5637-a7b9-3cd80db13ba3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-82458/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "c527bcc0-17b1-5c74-b