-1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFinally, $a=2,$ $b=1,$ $c=1$ and \n\n$$\na+b+c=2+1+1=4.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-82458/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6641b2cf-00bc-5542-a566-5b8689f2f2a4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-82458"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-82463/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "c1288acd-eaaf-509d-af95-aa00410e23d8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-82463/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "4f8b7768-2ff6-52e1-b84b-3ec177df330e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-82463/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "2067d5db-b04a-5ee6-b9fc-8a3b68225bd5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-82463/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "530d90f5-5823-59b1-8675-e8c3fa9708bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-82463/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "18ea65bf-a675-5df1-80f8-540c15c9a6d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-82463/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "82932d82-fd8f-50dc-99f9-63578a142ace" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-82463/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-82463/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" "q-82463/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-82463/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-82463/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-82463/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-82463" :question/id #uuid "8244aa38-38b9-55c6-a474-f3c55a938d78" :question/math-academy-id "q-82463" :question/problem "Let $B={{b}_{1},{b}_{2},{b}_{3}}$ be a basis of ${R}^{3}.$ The matrix $[\\,T\\,]_{B}$ of the linear transformation $T:{R}^{3}\\to {R}^{3}$ is given by\n\n$$\n[\\,T\\,]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ a & b & c\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFind the value of $\\,a+b+c,\\,$ given that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T({b}_{1}) & ={b}_{1}+{b}_{3}, \\\\ T({b}_{2}) & ={b}_{1}, \\\\ T({b}_{3}) & ={b}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we write down the coordinates of the images relative to the basis $B:$\n\n$$\n[T({b}_{1})]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,[T({b}_{2})]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\\,[T({b}_{3})]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNow, the $B$-matrix for $T$ is a matrix  whose columns are the coordinates of the vectors $T({b}_{1}),$ $T({b}_{2}),$ and $T({b}_{3})$ relative to the basis $B.$ Therefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n[\\,T\\,]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFinally, $a=1,$ $b=0,$ $c=0$ and \n\n$$\na+b+c=1+0+0=1.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-82463/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6641b2cf-00bc-5542-a566-5b8689f2f2a4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-82463"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-140369/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "25242ea2-97e7-5b14-b3e5-e847d9d4b502" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9"